<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JEPANIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Jepania</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jepania</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jep</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEPANIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Jepania otito kwena pa Lubanga ikine me mwaka miya abicel ki pyere angwen nio kwede i mwaka miya abicel ki pyere adek ma peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito. En otiyo ikare ma rwot Yocia peya ocako roco woro Lubanga i mwaka miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye acel ma peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito. Buk man tye ki lok me nebi mapire tek tutwal en aye ni; nino me akemo pa Rwot bibino me ngolo kop pi bal pa jo Juda me woro lubanga mukene. Rwot bipwodo jone kacel ki rok mukene ma pe giwore.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kadi bed kibipwodo Jerucalem ento kare bibino ma nongo kibidwoke i deyone mayam con, dok bene jo ma kitgi atir aye bibedo kunu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nino me ngolo kop pa Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEP 1:1-2:3">1:1—2:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Can bot lurok ma gurumu jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEP 2:4-15">2:4-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Can ki koko jo Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEP 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:1-23:30">2 Luk 22:1—23:30</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:1-35:27">2 Tek 34:1—35:27</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok pa Rwot mayam obino bot Jepania wod pa Kuci, wod pa Gedalia, wod pa Amaria, wod pa Kejekia ikare pa rwot Yocia me Juda, wod pa Amon.<verse eid="ZEP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino ma Rwot bingolo iye kop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2" />Rwot owaco ni, “Abijwero jami ducu ki iwi lobo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3" />Abijwero dano wa ki leegu ducu; abijwero winyo me polo wa ki rec me nam bene. Abityeko jo maracu woko ducu; dok abineno ni dano maracu dong kinekogi woko liweng ki iwi lobo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4" />Abiryeyo bada ikom Juda, ki ikom jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem pi pwodogi; dok abijwero jo pa Baal ma gudonge woko ducu ki i kabedo man, wa ki nying ajwaki ma gitiyo bot cal jogini wi dano bene biwil woko ikomgi. <verse eid="ZEP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5" />Dok bene abityeko jo ma ryebe piny iwi ot kaworo ceng, dwe, ki lakalatwer; ki jo ma giryebe piny ka kwongo kwong i Ot pa Rwot ma kun nongo kono bene gikwongo kwongo i nying lubanga Milkom bene. <verse eid="ZEP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6" />Abityeko jo ma gudok woko cen, ma pe gilubu an Rwot, gin jo ma pe yenyo wanga nyo penyo kony ki bota nyo pe gipenyo doga wek anyut botgi gin ma gutim.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7" />Wuling mot inyim Rwot Lubanga! Pien nino pa Rwot dong tye cok; Rwot dong otyeko yube me tyero jone, dong olwongo merok me balo Juda woko. <verse eid="ZEP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8" />Rwot owaco ni, “Inino me tyero gitum, abiketo can ikom luloc ki ikom lutino pa rwot ki ikom jo ducu ma gilubu kit pa lurok mukene. <verse eid="ZEP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9" />Inino meno abiketo can ikom jo ducu ma giworo lubanga Dagan kun nongo gikalo larii dogola, gin jo ma gitimo tim bwami ki loko lok goba i ot me woro jogigi.<verse eid="ZEP 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10" />Inino meno, koko biwinye ki i Dogcel me Rec, koko me can biwinye ki i but taun madit me Aryo, mor piny madwong biwinye ki iwi cere. <verse eid="ZEP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11" />Wukok can, wun jo ma wubedo i Pany<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fk">Pany </char> obedo nying kabedo mo mayam tye kama olunge ki i Jerucalem, dok obedo kabedo me cuk. </note>! Pien lucatwil dong gipeke, jo ma pimo ryal dong kityekogi woko. <verse eid="ZEP 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12" />Ikare meno abingiyo Jerucalem ki mac tara, abiketo can ikom jo ma gibedo abeda mot ma cwinygi okwe, jo ma giwaco ki i cwinygi ni, ‘Rwot pe bitiyo gin maber, dok pe bitimo gin marac.’ <verse eid="ZEP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13" />Jamigi kibiyako woko, odigi bene kibiketogi woko. Kadi bed guger odi, pe gibibedo i igi; kadi bed gupit olok, pe gibimato kongo bwinone.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14" />Nino madit pa Rwot dong tye onyiko cok, tye cok dok tye kabino oyotoyot; dwon me nino pa Rwot, dwon magwar, dano matek kok iye ki dwon malongo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15" />Nino meno aye nino me akemo, nino me can ki me remcwiny madwong, nino me nginyo ki me balo piny, nino me colpiny ki mutu, nino me pol ki colpiny mapek, <verse eid="ZEP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16" />nino me kutu tum ki woo me lweny ikom taun madito ma kicelo matek, ki ikom cel ma kigero maboco.<verse eid="ZEP 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17" />Rwot owaco ni, “Abikelo can ikom dano, ma bimiyo giwoto calo lutowang, pien gubalo inyim Rwot; kibionyo remogi woko i ngom ma pyete macalo apwa, ki ringo komgi kibibolo calo cet.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18" />Kadi ryalgi nyo jabugi pe bilarogi inino me akemo pa Rwot. Mac me akemo me nyekone biwango lobo ducu; en bityeko dano ducu ma gibedo i lobo ma kicel dok oyotoyot.<verse eid="ZEP 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lwongo dano pi ngut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1" />Wubin, wucoke kacel, wun rok ma lewic pe makowu, <verse eid="ZEP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2" />ma pud peya kiryemowu woko macalo cung kal ma yamo tingo, ma peya kiniga mager pa Rwot obino ikomwu, ma peya nino me akemo pa Rwot obino ikomwu. <verse eid="ZEP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3" />Wuyeny Rwot, wun jo ducu mamwol me lobo man, ma wucobo cike; wulub kit ma atir dok wubed ki mwolo; gwok nyo kibibwotowu pe kipwodowu inino me akemo ma Rwot binyutu iye kinigane.<verse eid="ZEP 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom rok ducu ma gurumu Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Ica 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eje 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Jek 9:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Gaja bidong nono, Acikelon bidoko obur, jo Acidod kibiryemogi woko dyeceng, Ekron kibiryemo woko. <verse eid="ZEP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5" />Ci wubineno can wun jo ma wubedo i dog nam, wun rok me Keret! Lok pa Rwot tye marac ikomwu, in Kanaan, lobo pa jo Piliciti; en bityeko in woko nio ka ngat mo pe bidong boti. <verse eid="ZEP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6" />In dog nam, ibidoko olet bar pa lukwat ki dwol romi. <verse eid="ZEP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7" />Lobo dog nam bidoko pa jo Juda ma gudong, ci gibikwayo romigi iye; gibibutu piny otyeno i odi me Acikelon. Pien Rwot Lubangagi biparo pirgi, ci bidwoko gum botgi bene odoco.<verse eid="ZEP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8" />Rwot owaco ni, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Ica 15:1—16:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-49:6">Jer 48:1—49:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eje 21:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-11">25:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1:13-15</ref></char></note>“Dong awinyo lok anywar pa jo Moab ki yet pa jo Ammon, ki kit ma gin nywaro ki jona, kun ginyutu tek me lobogi ikom jona ni gin gibimayo lobogi woko. <verse eid="ZEP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref></char></note>Pimeno, macalo an Rwot Lubanga me Icrael atye makwoni, Moab bidoko calo Codom, jo Ammon bidoko calo Gomorra, en lobo ma opong ki ayila ki bur kado, ma dong obale matwal. Jona ma gin gudong biyakogi, jona ma gubwot ki ikin roka bileyo lobogi.”<verse eid="ZEP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10" />Man bitime ikom jo Moab ki jo Ammon macalo adwogi me wakegi, pien gungalo jo pa Rwot me mony dok bene guwake ikomgi. <verse eid="ZEP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11" />Rwot bikelo lworo madwong ikomgi ikare ma en bijwiko lwak lubangagu ducu ma iwi lobo, lobo pa lurok ducu bene gibiryebe piny inyime me wore, rok acel acel biworo en ki i kabedogi.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 18:1-7">Ica 18:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wun jo Etiopia bene, kibinekowu ki pala lucwana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Ica 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nak 1:1—3:19</ref></char></note>Rwot biryeyo cinge tung kumalo, ci bityeko jo Aciria woko; ci en biloko Nineve doko obur ma otwo calo tim aroo. <verse eid="ZEP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14" />Lim makwo bibutu i dyere kacel ki lee me tim ducu; acut ki coo gibibedo i wir odine; tula bikok ki i wang dirica, agak bikok i larii dogola; pien bao cedar dong kiyako kibalo woko. <verse eid="ZEP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15" />Man aye gin ma bitime ikom taun madit ma jone yam nyateni pi teke kun giwaco ni gitye kabedo me kuc, man aye gang ma oloko kekene ni, “An atye, dok pe tye ngat mo mukene.” Kit ma en odoko kwede obur, ki boro pa lee tim! Ngat acel acel makato ki ingete bipong ki ur madit kun jwiye ajwiya ma yengo ki wiye me nyutu cacgi ikom kabedo meno.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa Jerucalem ki kokone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1" />Can bipoto ikom taun madit me Jerucalem ma jone gudoko lubwami dok lujemo, ma unu jogi kikome! <verse eid="ZEP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2" />En pe winyo dwon ngat mo, dok pe ye juk pa ngat mo, pe geno Rwot, dok bene pe nyiko cok ki Lubangane. <verse eid="ZEP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3" />Ludito ma gitye iye girom ki twoni labwor ma mor; lungolkop ma mere gical ki orudi ma mako lee i dyewor ci pe giweko gin mo dong nio wa odiko. <verse eid="ZEP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4" />Lunebine gin jo ma owor. Ajwakine gibalo Ot pa Rwot giweko bedo me kwer, gin jo ma pe gene; dok bene giloko cik pa Lubanga me tiyo gin ma cwinygi mito. <verse eid="ZEP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5" />Ento Rwot ma bedo iye opore, en pe tiyo gin marac; ma odiko ducu en pe keng ngolo kop kakare, en pe keng tice bene rupiny ki rupiny, ento jo ma lubalo mede amede ki bal ma lewic bene pe makogi.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6" />Rwot owaco ni, “Atyeko jwero rok mapol; celgi matek odoko obur; atyeko balo yoogi woko, mamiyo ngat mo pe woto iye; taun gi madito odong obur, labongo dano i igi. <verse eid="ZEP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7" />Ci awaco ni, ‘Adada Jerucalem bilwora, biye juk; wiye pe biwil ikom loka ducu ma aciko en kwede.’ Ento gin pud gimede ameda ki mitkom me timo bal kare ducu. <verse eid="ZEP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8" />Pimeno, wukura, wukur nino ma abia iye malo ka dot. Pien amoko tama me coko rok ducu, ki pi guru ker mapol kacel, wek ato kinigana ikomgi, wek akemona malyeti otum; pien akemo me nyekona biwango lobo ducu. <verse eid="ZEP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9" />Ada, ikare meno abiloko rok ducu miyo gibiloko lok ma opore kakare, wek gin ducu gulwong nyinga an Rwot, dok gutii bota ki cwiny acel. <verse eid="ZEP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10" />Gin jona ma guket woko atani, gibikela mota ki kwacgi bene, kun gia ki loka kulu me Etiopia. <verse eid="ZEP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11" />Inino meno pe kibiketo lewic ikomi pi tim ma ijemo kwede ikoma; ikare meno abikwanyo woko ki ikinwu jo mayam ginyate ma gikete malo; pe dok wubimede ki jemo iwi got mera maleng. <verse eid="ZEP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12" />Jo mamwol ma lucan abiweko dong ikinwu, gin jo ma biyenyo kony ki bota, <verse eid="ZEP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:5">Niy 14:5</ref></char></note>gibiyenyo kalare i nying Rwot; pe gibitimo gin marac, dok pe gibiloko lok goba; leb ma bwolo dano bene pe binonge i doggi. Gibicam, dok gibibutu piny, pe tye ngat mo ma bimiyogi lworo.”<verse eid="ZEP 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wer me yomcwiny</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14" />Wuwer ki dwon malongo, wun jo Cion; wugo kijira, wun anyira Icrael!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:14">Wubed ki yomcwiny wunyate ki cwinywu ducu, wun jo Jerucalem.<verse eid="ZEP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15" />Rwot dong okwanyo kop woko ki ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:15">dok bene otyeko ryemo lukworwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:15">Rwot tye ikinwu, en rwot me Icrael;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:15">pe dok wubilworo gin marac.<verse eid="ZEP 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16" />Inino meno kibiwaco ki Jerucalem ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:16">“Pe wulwor, wun jo Cion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:16">pe wuwek cingwu odok nyap!<verse eid="ZEP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17" />Rwot Lubangawu tye ikinwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">en twon oteka lweny ma bikeliwu loc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">En bium ikomwu ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">pi mar mere botwu en birocowu wudoko manyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">binyutu yomcwiny madit ikomwu ki wer malongo<verse eid="ZEP 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18" />macalo inino madito.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ZEP 3:18">Rwot waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:18">“Abikwanyo can woko ki ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:18">wek pe kiyetwu pire.<verse eid="ZEP 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19" />Nen, ikare meno abitiyo tica ikom dano ducu mayam giunuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:19">Abilaro lungolo, dok abicoko jo mayam kiketogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:19">abiloko lewicgi doko pak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:19">ci nyinggi biwinye i lobo ducu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20" />Ikare meno abikelowu paco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">ikare ma abicokowu kacel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">Eyo, abimiyo nyingwu ywek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">dok kibipakowu, ikin jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">en kare ma abidwoko gum botwu kun wuneno ki wangwu.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">Man an Rwot aye ma awaco.<verse eid="ZEP 3:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3" />
</usx>